{"event": {"id": "b674fef764a1", "type": "feature.intake", "at": "2026-10-19T11:11:56Z", "payload": {"feature": "token-ledger-and-statusline", "text": "Token ledger and statusline (T3)\nReal, always-visible token consumption for Spec Master sessions.\nIncremental stdlib transcript JSONL reader with persisted offset, no hardcoded paths\nTokens (input/output/cache_read/cache_creation), model and estimated cost attributed to feature/phase/agent\nAttribution events written to .spec-master/events.jsonl by adapter hooks\nOptional stdlib OTLP/HTTP JSON receiver feeds the same ledger\nmetrics round schema v2 with cache/model/cost, v1 still readable\nStatusline shows feature, phase, tier, tokens, cost, cache hit, context %\ncalibration uses real tokens when available\nUnknown transcript format degrades to 0 + note, never invents counts", "paths": []}}, "fired": [{"hook": "sensitivity-schema", "action": "raise_tier", "directive": {"hook": "sensitivity-schema", "type": "raise_tier", "category": "schema", "floor": "M", "feature": "token-ledger-and-statusline"}}]}
